                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 mb-1.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
                                <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide">备课</span>
                            </a></li>
                            <li><a href="../teacher/gauge.aspx" class="group flex flex-col items-center py-3 px-2 rounded-xl text-slate-500 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-all duration-200">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 mb-1.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                                <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide">量规</span>
                            </a></li>
                            <li><a href="../teacher/works.aspx" class="group flex flex-col items-center py-3 px-2 rounded-xl text-slate-500 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-all duration-200">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 mb-1.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                                <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide">作品</span>
                            </a></li>
                            <li><a href="../teacher/signin.aspx" class="group flex flex-col items-center py-3 px-2 rounded-xl text-slate-500 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:text-indigo-600 transition-all duration-200">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 mb-1.5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                                <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide">签到</span>
                            </a></li>
